==Other Appearances==
==={{HW|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
Ravio's Hood appears as part of Ravio's outfit in {{HW}}. In {{HWL}}, the [[Rabbit Hood]] is also [[Fairy Clothing]] that [[Companion Fairy|Companion Fairies]] can equip in [[My Fairy]]'s [[Salon]].
{{Noncanon|End}}

==Trivia==
* The effect given by Ravio's Hood in {{BotW}} is a nod to the power given by [[Ravio's Bracelet]] in {{ALBW|-}}, as horizontal movement is the only means of navigating while [[Wall Merging]].

